Package: fastmsna
Type: Package
Title: Fast, Survey-Correct Descriptive Analysis for Large MSNA Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("IMPACT", "NGA", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tomasbeyene21@gmail.com"))
Description: A performance-optimised re-implementation of the descriptive
    analysis functions of the 'analysistools' package (means, medians,
    select-one and select-multiple proportions, ratios) for large
    humanitarian / Multi-Sector Needs Assessment (MSNA) datasets. Estimates,
    Taylor-linearised confidence intervals, sample sizes and analysis keys
    are statistically equivalent to 'analysistools' (srvyr/survey), but are
    computed with grouped matrix operations over all domains at once instead
    of one survey-design subset per group and indicator.
